      "content": "This memo should clearly state that while employees have free speech rights, the workplace is a professional environment, and political expression must not disrupt business operations or create a hostile work environment. The company must enforce a policy that prohibits disruptive or harassing political commentary, ensuring that all employees can focus on their jobs without undue political pressure. A strong, unified culture requires setting clear boundaries where professional conduct always supersedes personal political advocacy.",
