      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A blanket ban is the most effective way to ensure a truly equitable workplace where everyone feels safe, regardless of their political leanings. Framing the policy around \"company values\" is a dangerous slippery slope that inevitably allows the majority's preferred social justice narrative to become the de facto standard. To genuinely support inclusion, the company must enforce a strict separation between personal political activism and professional conduct, which means limiting expression to non-partisan, universally accepted workplace standards.",
